# Generated build artifacts (rendered by `mage build`).
figures/*.png
generated-files/

# Shared skill/command symlinks (per-item links to coding-skills and
# writing-skills; absolute local paths, not portable). Never committed.
.claude/commands/
.claude/skills/

# Compiled helper binaries (built by `go build ./cmd/...`).
/genoutline
# `go build ./...` inside the package dir drops the binary beside its source,
# which the root-anchored rule above does not catch (GH-71).
cmd/genoutline/genoutline
